# Input Entry Contract (MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-input-entry-contract.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-input-entry-contract.md)

## Single responsibility

| Action | Opens | Never |
|--------|-------|-------|
| **Scan** | Document scanner (or document-oriented capture) | File picker; photo-mode-first camera |
| **Snap** | Live camera (moment happening now) | Document scanner |
| **Upload** | System file picker | Camera; scanner |
| **Share** | OS Share Target into SolenOS | Separate product path |

## Pipeline (non-negotiable)

All origins → Evidence Understanding → Care Reality → Situation Relationship Engine → Response Contract.

Origin must never change reasoning. `entry_method` = attribution only.

## Caregiver feel

They choose the easiest way to provide evidence. SolenOS builds understanding — never format homework.
